<p id="S5.SS3.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS3.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">by definition, (<a href="#S5.E4" title="In Lemma 5.16. ‣ 5.3. Interpretation as the count of colorings ‣ 5. Characteristic polynomial of ℳ̄_{0,𝑛} ‣ Characteristic polynomial of ℳ̄_{0,𝑛} and log-concavity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.4</span></a>) is immediate. See also <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib11" title="" class="ltx_ref">11</a>, Lemmas 4.3]</cite>.
